💡 Business Insights & Recommendations

 📍 Sylhet Upzila Underperformance Analysis

Key Finding:
Sylhet is the lowest-performing Upzila generating approximately **₹55.12 lakh in revenue**, which is 51.27% below the median Upzila revenue benchmark

The analysis indicates that the underperformance is **not primarily driven by customer-base size, transaction value, product mix, or individual store performance**. The major issue is **low customer engagement, weak retention, and low purchase frequency**.

